- R21 (niveau B) : Foster C, Florhaug JA, Franklin J, Gottschall L, Hrovatin LA, Parker S, Doleshal P, Dodge C, 2001. A new approach to monitoring exercise training. Journal of Strength and Conditioning Research 15(1):109–115.
