- R28 (niveau A) : Walsh NP, Halson SL, Sargent C, Roach GD, Nédélec M, Gupta L, Leeder J, Fullagar HHK, Coutts AJ, Edwards BJ, Pullinger SA, Robertson CM, Burniston JG, Lastella M, Le Meur Y, Hausswirth C, Bender AM, Grandner MA, Samuels CH, 2021. Sleep and the athlete: narrative review and 2021 expert consensus recommendations. British Journal of Sports Medicine 55(7):356–368.
